==English==
[[Image:CraneFly.jpg|thumb|Cranefly.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|crane-fly|crane fly}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|crane|fly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɹeɪnˌflaɪ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various large [[fly|flies]] of the suborder {{taxfmt|Tipulomorpha|infraorder}} that have slender bodies and very long legs and that resemble giant [[mosquito]]es.

====Synonyms====
* {{q|UK}} [[daddy longlegs]]
* {{q|US}} [[gullywhumper]], [[gollywhopper]], [[mosquito hawk]]

====Coordinate terms====
* {{l|en|leatherjacket}} {{qf|cranefly larva}}

